{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/b6a5b49eb19ffb62811e0e312d216aaa.webp?t=1762250764\" width=388 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/cb12be3a498b4a9652f71760a56d133d.poster.avif?t=1762250764\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/cb12be3a498b4a9652f71760a56d133d.webm?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/cb12be3a498b4a9652f71760a56d133d.mp4?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Mossport, a vibrant seaside city, where Witchbrook College opens its doors to aspiring witches like you!<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/4132171fb452c973e3acdacaaafc6475.webp?t=1762250764\" width=389 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/0bfcee1060a242575db0d1fa9893cb90.poster.avif?t=1762250764\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/0bfcee1060a242575db0d1fa9893cb90.webm?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/0bfcee1060a242575db0d1fa9893cb90.mp4?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city of Mossport is a living, breathing world; teeming with life, even when you\u2019re not looking! From cityfolk with intricate and unique daily routines, to community events that mark the changing of the seasons.  <br> <br>Just like you, your coven, teachers, and the cityfolk all lead busy lives! Every character has their own unique schedule, whether they\u2019re working in one of Mossport\u2019s many businesses, having a drink at the pub, cramming for their next exam in the college library or joining in with the festivities at the seasonal events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the academic year, so too does life around Mossport. Watch the cityfolk shed their mittens as the Winter snowfall melts away, allowing for the gradual bloom of colourful Spring flowers and donning of sun hats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the seasons change, so do the rhythms of the city and its vibrant community...<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/f65fe82ec75f84e28c26aec13b926762.webp?t=1762250764\" width=450 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/f40d40309df59f630e8eb22f870e187d.poster.avif?t=1762250764\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/f40d40309df59f630e8eb22f870e187d.webm?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/f40d40309df59f630e8eb22f870e187d.mp4?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your magical abilities by attending classes, completing assignments, and expanding your knowledge at Witchbrook College. Feeling confident? Harness those skills to ace your exams and let your magic flow through Mossport! Master magical arts; brew potent potions, compete with your coven to be top of the class, participate in mysterious rituals, and consult the stars to see what the future holds\u2026<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/9756a2465ed63a5ff39a60f0080d2d24.webp?t=1762250764\" width=387 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/cbfe97c1075dbf7f7dbb7a95206d6219.poster.avif?t=1762250764\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/cbfe97c1075dbf7f7dbb7a95206d6219.webm?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/cbfe97c1075dbf7f7dbb7a95206d6219.mp4?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create lasting memories and life-long friendships or maybe flirt with finding romance amidst a colourful cast of datable characters. Share adventures, exchange secrets, and uncover a deeper connection with your Coven.<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/926f205e10a1c43475ccbea22717c74f.webp?t=1762250764\" width=387 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/7d38d5234cf75bde7be4828e6cd993bd.poster.avif?t=1762250764\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/7d38d5234cf75bde7be4828e6cd993bd.webm?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/7d38d5234cf75bde7be4828e6cd993bd.mp4?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your unique aesthetic with customisable clothing, hair and accessories. Renovate your cosy woodland cottage how you see fit, and transform the surrounding garden into a thriving habitat for plants and wildlife. Use your newfound resources to start a business; helping locals and partnering with shops to fund your studies.<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/0f641baddf2af64763c0e726dc4e9c7c.webp?t=1762250764\" width=387 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/6238303ff98b1697b3de3b5b712d2310.poster.avif?t=1762250764\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/6238303ff98b1697b3de3b5b712d2310.webm?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/6238303ff98b1697b3de3b5b712d2310.mp4?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s more to life than just your witch studies! Spend your free time (and your hard-earned witch-business profits) however you please. Shop \u2018til you drop at Mossport\u2019s boutiques and eateries, and sell your crafts at the Sunday market. Or spend your weekend chasing a new highscore at the arcade, documenting Mossport through your camera lens, or picking out the perfect gift for a romantic date. Mossport is full of ways to unwind and express yourself!<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/a872ce3513c30c7ff363f2a20b146559.webp?t=1762250764\" width=450 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/96e4e69c696d8ac2a591c1a865cd87c1.poster.avif?t=1762250764\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/96e4e69c696d8ac2a591c1a865cd87c1.webm?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/96e4e69c696d8ac2a591c1a865cd87c1.mp4?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can experience this spellbinding adventure in online co-op. Whether you\u2019re racing on brooms through the park, honing your spellcrafting know-how or just enjoying hanging out in idyllic Mossport, there\u2019s always more fun to be had with friends!<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/111ef47e6c8eae30f34a11d797306fdc.apng?t=1762250764\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/111ef47e6c8eae30f34a11d797306fdc.poster.avif?t=1762250764\" class=\"bb_img\" width=610 height=120 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1846700?t=1762250764","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/ead93eea28f293d2ef4e652cf4b79a31edbe9cae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762250764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/86ceee35583b2f963db9246e87d9d93bef897811/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762250764","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/86ceee35583b2f963db9246e87d9d93bef897811/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762250764","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/b6a5b49eb19ffb62811e0e312d216aaa.webp?t=1762250764\" width=388 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/cb12be3a498b4a9652f71760a56d133d.poster.avif?t=1762250764\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/cb12be3a498b4a9652f71760a56d133d.webm?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/18