ding garden into a thriving habitat for plants and wildlife. Use your newfound resources to start a business; helping locals and partnering with shops to fund your studies.<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/0f641baddf2af64763c0e726dc4e9c7c.webp?t=1762250764\" width=387 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/6238303ff98b1697b3de3b5b712d2310.poster.avif?t=1762250764\" width=610 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/6238303ff98b1697b3de3b5b712d2310.webm?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/6238303ff98b1697b3de3b5b712d2310.mp4?t=1762250764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s more to life than just your witch studies! Spend your free time (and your hard-earned witch-business profits) however you please. Shop \u2018til you drop at Mossport\u2019s boutiques and eateries, and sell your crafts at the Sunday market. Or spend your weekend chasing a new highscore at the arcade, documenting Mossport through your camera lens, or picking out the perfect gift for a romantic date. Mossport is full of ways to unwind and express yourself!<br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846700/extras/a872ce3513c30c7ff363f2a20b146559.webp?t=1762250764\" width=450 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span 